<h1>About Meridian Castings</h1>

<p>Meridian Castings Limited designs and manufactures precision castings, machined components and finished assemblies for the automotive, rail, off-highway, fluid power and general engineering sectors. The company was founded in Sheffield in 1962 and today employs around 860 people across three sites in England, Wales and Poland.</p>

<p>We combine traditional foundry skills with modern process control: induction melting, no-bake and shell moulding, coordinate measuring, and a machining base of over forty CNC turning and milling centres. Most of our customers have worked with us for more than a decade, and several of our tooling designs have been in continuous production for over twenty years.</p>

<p>Meridian Castings is a private company, wholly owned by the Coulthard family trust since the 1978 merger that created the group. Day-to-day operations are led by our executive team, with oversight from a board chaired by James Coulthard, grandson of founder Harold Coulthard.</p>

